# =========================================================
# .gitignore Universal: React Native, Kotlin & Flutter
# Cubre carpeta principal y subcarpetas recursivamente
# =========================================================

# --- Archivos del Sistema y Editores ---
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.suo
*.user

# --- Node / React Native (Recursivo) ---
**/node_modules/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.eslintcache

# React Native iOS
**/ios/build/
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/DerivedData/
**/ios/*.xcworkspace
**/ios/.xcode.env.local

# --- Flutter (Recursivo) ---
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/build/
**/lib/generated_plugin_registrant.dart
**/ios/.generated/

# --- Android / Kotlin (Recursivo) ---
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/captures/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/build/
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/

# Archivos de firma y secretos (¡IMPORTANTE!)
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.key
**/local.properties

# --- Herramientas de Despliegue ---
**/fastlane/report.xml
**/fastlane/Preview.html
**/fastlane/screenshots
**/fastlane/test_output

# --- Logs y Temporales ---
**/logs
*.log
**/tmp/